air cockpit teamwork. In contrast, Candidate B is very conscientious, handles stress well, good at assessing weather, which are critical for long-distance flights. While B is regarded as pretentious and sometimes adopts the wrong tone, these issues seem less likely to jeopardize safety than D's temperament. Therefore I would provisionally recommend Candidate B.\"\n\nMake sure to include vote in metadata."}
